<article class="env-exercise" id="02Q3">
<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02Q3">Exercise <span data-tag="02Q3">9.1.2.15</span>.</a> Let $\operatorname{\mathcal{C}}$ be an $\infty $-category and let $n \geq 1$ be an integer. Show that the ($\operatorname {h}\! \mathit{\operatorname{Kan}}$-enriched) homotopy category $\operatorname {h}\! \mathit{\operatorname{\mathcal{C}}}$ satisfies condition $(\ast _ n)$ of Definition <a data-tag="02PN" href="/tag/02PN">9.1.2.1</a> if and only if $\operatorname{\mathcal{C}}$ satisfies condition $(\ast '_{n})$ of Lemma <a data-tag="02Q0" href="/tag/02Q0">9.1.2.12</a>. </p>
